  "answer": "If you changed your Flex flight to a cheaper date, you will not get the difference back. According to our policy, if the new fare is lower than the original fare, the difference is not refunded. However, you are entitled to a full refund up to 2 hours before departure, provided you make the request in time. If you have already made the change, please check the refund conditions based on your specific situation and contact our customer support for further assistance.",
